## 3.2 Test Scope
#### 3.2.1 In Scope
- API authentication validation
- Error handling for unauthorized access

#### 3.2.2 Out of Scope
- Functional testing of AD-488 requirements (description unavailable)
  - Reason: Jira issue description not accessible due to API 401 Unauthorized error.

